# {instance_name} — agent instructions

This is a **private FilingCabinet instance**, not the framework. The engine and CLI live in the
[FilingCabinet](https://github.com/meridun/FilingCabinet) repository, pinned at
`{framework_version}`. Do not edit engine code from here; file an issue in the framework repo.

## Invariants

- **Tools never move or rename documents unasked** (framework `docs/Architecture.md` §6). Index
  and propose; a human confirms; `apply` is explicit, logged in the move-log, and reversible.
- **No document bytes and no credentials in this directory.** Documents stay in the Drive folder.
  The `.gitignore` blocks document and database formats; never force-add past it.
- **Never grant broad Drive or app access.** Scope credentials to the indexed document folder.
- `[paths].data_dir` is local-only; `[paths].snapshot_dir` is the cloud-synced one.

## Usage

Run every verb against this instance's config:

```
filingcabinet --config {config_path} status
filingcabinet --config {config_path} ingest
```
